notes: PC Studio can browse persistent captures, save manual bounding-box labels using the shared six-class schema, and build a managed datasets/yolo/data.yaml train/validation dataset for the existing optional Ultralytics runner. Bad-quality captures are excluded and label changes make the managed dataset stale until rebuilt. This candidate is not passed until the owner completes the acceptance checklist. Automatic labeling, live AI inference, model export, and physical traffic control are not implemented.
